<title>USA: Whitman Corp Q1 net edges lower, revs rise.</title>
<headline>Whitman Corp Q1 net edges lower, revs rise.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.15		   $ 0.15</p>
<p> Net			 15,500		   16,000</p>
<p> Revs/Sales	     674,100		  657,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 103,700		  107,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 total operating profit $35.2 million vs $38.1 million in 1996 Q1; 1997 Q1 international operating losses $5.9 million vs losses of $4.3 million in 1996 Q1.</p>
